        "title": "He kanloumeipu nangta ning tan mak",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He kanloumeipu nangta ningtan mak,",
            "Akhang rianra muang kumma jing e;",
            "He nang lun gaimei rianra kuakmei,",
            "Tingkauh ganphiu gan pat datro.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He ningtan makge ata nduang lou o,",
            "Nangrui ram mak kanloumeipu;",
            "Tingjing ngam makge.",
            "",
            "2. Kapma bam pui bam rianra ram khou hei,",
            "Pat lou rio he kanloumeipu;",
            "He nang jaujian rui ata jailou o,",
            "Ping pui chang khou tat bam khou hei.",
            "",
            "3. Theimei Jardon dui dai bam khuan sini,",
            "Nduang lou o he guang Jisu le;",
            "He kachak namdai gaimei chang khou 7#@,",
            "Neila luh suan na titat ro.",
            "",
            "4. Salem namdai ringmei thingbang lim khou,",
            "Bumang thanmei rui nduang gutni;",
            "Nangrui ram mak ai hei he kanloumei pu,",
            "Nangta ninga tingjing ngam amkge."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
